          ["Mufti WP — Bayan Siri 23: Waktu Dam Tamattu", "https://muftiwp.gov.my/ms/artikel/bayan-li-al-haj/702-bayan-al-haj-siri-23-waktu-sesuai-melaksanakan-dam-tamattu"],
